    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no new rhythm. everything i was was tied to being able to move, to compete, to be the best. without that, i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. it feels like the story was supposed to end when my career ended. now i'm just a long, pointless epilogue that nobody asked for.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
